  "conclusion_detail": "Event-Risk Budgeter is NULL. Best event strategy Sharpe 0.9207 vs 50/50 0.9593 (Δ=-0.0386). Only FOMC shows significant vol premium (+28%, confirms K513). NFP/CPI are NOT significant. Reducing exposure COSTS returns because event days have positive mean returns (Savor-Wilson macro premium). VIX regime dominates event identity (confirms K528/K661/K741). Cross-OOS: Event_v1 beats 50/50 0/5. The 12/VIX strategy already handles event risk implicitly via VIX level. Adding event calendar overlay to 12/VIX does NOT improve performance.",
